stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Init
    Init: 載入 profile + feedback map<br/>開啟 AuditDb (WAL)
    Init --> WaitFd: recv_fd via SCM_RIGHTS
    WaitFd --> Polling: notify_fd 取得

    state Polling {
        [*] --> poll_block
        poll_block: poll([notify_fd, signal_fd], -1)
        poll_block --> recv_notif: notify_fd 可讀
        recv_notif: ioctl NOTIF_RECV
        recv_notif --> resolve: 取得 SeccompNotif
        resolve: policy.match(nr)<br/>feedback.build()
        resolve --> record: 寫 syscall_events
        record --> respond
        respond: ioctl NOTIF_SEND<br/>(ALLOW / errno / CONTINUE)
        respond --> poll_block
    }

    Polling --> Telemetry: 每 100ms tick
    Telemetry: 讀 cgroup<br/>寫 resource_samples
    Telemetry --> Polling

    Polling --> Shutdown: SIGTERM / target exit
    Shutdown: flush DB<br/>close notify_fd
    Shutdown --> [*]
